   "title_cn": "南苏丹琼莱州杜克县冲突致至少13人死亡",
   "title_original": "13 killed in Duk County violence",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹琼莱州杜克县与邻近特维克东县青年之间发生冲突，当地官员称至少13名杜克县青年死亡、26人受伤。冲突发生在杜克帕尤尔地区琼莱运河附近的Apiir Palaadhiim村，持续至周四大部分时间。官员表示搜寻仍在进行，死亡人数可能上升，特维克东县方面伤亡情况不明。",
   "summary_original": "At least 13 people have been killed and 26 others injured in fighting between young The post 13 killed in Duk County violence appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-09-25T14:00:58Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-25T14:00:58Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.radiotamazuj.org/en/news/article/13-killed-in-duk-county-violence",
     "source_name": "Radio Tamazuj",
     "source_group": "ssd",
     "language": "en"
    }
   ],
   "potential_impact": "",
   "progress": "",
   "current_policy_passed": true,
   "quality_gate_passed": true,
