   "title_cn": "阿韦尔妇女领袖承诺打击强迫婚姻与早婚",
   "title_original": "Aweil women’s leader vows to tackle forced, early marriages",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹北加扎勒河州阿韦尔中心县妇女协会新当选主席阿布克·阿齐贝尔·安达尔承诺，将开展反对强迫婚姻、早婚和性别暴力的运动。她表示女孩应继续留在学校接受教育，并呼吁家长不要因怀孕或经济困难迫使女孩结婚。当地活动人士称，经济状况恶化正导致强迫婚姻和早婚现象增多。",
   "summary_original": "The newly elected chairperson of the women’s association in Aweil Centre County, Northern Bahr el The post Aweil women’s leader vows to tackle forced, early marriages appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-09-25T08:39:04Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-25T08:39:04Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
