   "title_cn": "南非接连发现遇害女性遗体引发恐慌",
   "title_original": "Grim discoveries of murdered women spark fear in South Africa",
   "summary_cn": "南非埃库鲁莱尼地区自7月以来发现9具遇害女性遗体，其中3具于本周被发现，引发全国对针对女性暴力问题的愤怒与恐慌。警方表示尚不确定是否为连环杀手作案，案件之间可能并无关联。南非人权委员会数据显示，今年4月至6月有569名女性被杀，另有1052人遭遇谋杀未遂。",
   "summary_original": "Dineo Motapane is one of nine recent victims whose deaths have left a nation traumatised over the level of violence against women.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-18T23:04:41Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-18T23:04:41Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [],
   "potential_impact": "",
   "progress": "",
