   "title_cn": "加纳阿克拉部委区约30个消防栓仅5个可用",
   "title_original": "Fire Service finds only five functional hydrants in Ministries enclave",
   "summary_cn": "加纳阿克拉部委区接受检查的约30个消防栓中，仅5个完全可用，另有2个水压偏低、23个无法使用。大阿克拉地区消防指挥部与加纳水务有限公司联合开展此次检查，旨在防火季前排查并修复故障消防栓。该消息目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "Only five of about 30 fire hydrants inspected within the Ministries enclave in Accra were found to be fully functional, raising concerns about firefighting preparedness in the area. The inspection was conducted by the Greater Accra Regional Fire Command in collaboration with Ghana Water Limited as part of efforts to identify and restore faulty hydrants ahead of the fire season. Two of the hydrants inspected recorded low water pressure, while the remaining 23 were non-functional. The exercise als",
