   "summary_cn": "据警方消息，南非两处城镇发生两起枪击事件，造成至少27人死亡、20余人受伤。其中第一起事件于周六晚间发生在约翰内斯堡西南部韦德拉的一家酒馆，至少17人死亡、15人受伤。警方表示正在展开搜捕。该消息目前为单一来源。",
   "summary_original": "At least 27 people have been killed and more than 20 wounded in two shootings in two South African townships, according to police. In the first incident late on Saturday, at least 17 people were killed and 15 wounded in a shooting at a tavern in Wedela southwest of Johannesburg. Police said they were searching […]",
