   "title_original": "Gunmen killed at least 27 people in two mass shootings in South Africa",
   "summary_cn": "据警方消息，南非两座最大城市发生两起独立的大规模枪击事件，枪手共造成至少27人死亡。其中一起发生在约翰内斯堡以西一间酒吧，八名持突击步枪的枪手向顾客开火，造成17人死亡、15人受伤。该事件目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "Gunmen killed at least 27 people in two mass shootings in South Africa’s two largest cities, police said Sunday, in the latest violence to strike the crime-weary country",
