   "title_original": "South Africa: 11th woman found dead as killings raise alarm",
   "summary_cn": "南非约翰内斯堡以东的埃库鲁莱尼市一处空地发现一名女性遗体，使该地区过去10周内发现的女性遗体数量升至11具。警方称，一名路过的安保公司车辆发现遗体并报警。遇害者身份、年龄及死因尚未确定。当地接连发生的杀害女性事件引发担忧。",
   "summary_original": "The discovery of another woman's body in a municipality east of Johannesburg has brought the number of women found dead in the area over the past 10 weeks to 11, deepening concerns over a string of killings in a country already struggling with severe levels of violence against women.",
