   "summary_cn": "加纳前财政部长、议会财政委员会资深成员穆罕默德·阿明·亚当声称，新爱国党（NPP）此前实施的燃油价格纾困措施比政府当前每升柴油降价2塞地的举措范围更广、更具持久性。该说法为单一来源报道，尚未获得其他来源交叉验证。",
   "summary_original": "Former Finance Minister and Ranking Member on Parliament’s Finance Committee, Dr Mohammed Amin Adam, has argued that the NPP implemented broader and more permanent measures to cushion consumers from rising fuel prices than the current GH¢2 reduction in the price of diesel being offered by the government. Dr Amin Adam made the claim in a […]",
