   "title_cn": "评论文章：加纳DVLA不应将驾照过期者一律视为违规者",
   "title_original": "Appiah Adomako writes: Why DVLA must stop treating every expired licence holder as delinquent",
   "summary_cn": "加纳一篇评论文章指出，CUTS约六周前对加纳驾驶员与车辆牌照管理局（DVLA）针对驾照逾期续期和更换收取违规费用的做法提出关切。文章认为，仅持有过期驾照本身并不构成犯罪，只有在持过期驾照驾驶时才构成违法。该文章为单一来源的评论观点。",
   "summary_original": "About six weeks ago, CUTS raised concerns about the Driver and Vehicle Licensing Authority’s (DVLA) delinquency charges for late renewal and replacement of a driver’s licence. Our position is that merely holding an expired licence does not, in itself, constitute a crime. It only becomes an offence when one drives with an expired licence, as […]",
