   "summary_cn": "南非一个反移民运动组织发出9月30日最后期限，要求无证外国公民离境，引发移民社区普遍焦虑。该组织名为March and March，今年以来已发起多场抗议活动，并警告若诉求未获满足将举行更多示威。目前仅有一个来源报道此事。",
   "summary_original": "An impending September 30 deadline issued by an anti-immigration movement has ignited profound anxiety across migrant communities in South Africa. The group, known as March and March, has spearheaded protests throughout the year demanding that undocumented foreign nationals leave the country. Organisers warn of further demonstrations if their demands remain unmet. For many refugees, however, […]",
