   "title_original": "South Africa township residents demand action after deadly shootings",
   "summary_cn": "南非多个乡镇在发生一系列致命枪击事件后，居民恐惧情绪加剧，呼吁加强安全措施。约翰内斯堡西南部Wedela的居民称，过去与非法采矿团伙有关的枪击事件已令社区深感不安，此次袭击造成17人以上死亡。居民表示此类事件在当地从未发生过。",
   "summary_original": "The violence comes amid a wider rise in deadly mass shootings across South Africa, with residents in affected communities increasingly demanding protection as authorities confront persistent gang activity and illegal firearms.",
