   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚北部战事持续，引发人道主义担忧",
   "title_original": "Fighting rages in northern Ethiopia, raising humanitarian concerns",
   "summary_cn": "埃塞俄比亚北部战事在周末持续，提格雷人民解放阵线武装已越过提格雷地区。该阵线称其正在对阿比·艾哈迈德政府进行“防御性战争”，并已夺取机场、向邻近的阿法尔和阿姆哈拉州发动攻击。人权观察组织警告该本已动荡的地区可能出现人道主义危机。",
   "summary_original": "Fighting in the north of Ethiopia continued to rage over the weekend, as rebels of the Tigray People's Liberation Front moved beyond Tigray. Human Rights Watch warned against a possible humanitarian crisis in an already troubled region.",
