   "publication_reason": "Stage 3B 真实采集",
   "body_extracted": "However, Pretoria will \"not interfere\" with the US programme, Lamola said.\nHe also said that  South Africa  stands by its  genocide  case against  Israel  at the  International Court of Justice  over the  war in Gaza , despite pressure from the  Trump  administration to drop the case.\nFinally, Lamola rejected  Nigeria 's accusations over recent anti-foreigner violence in South Africa as \"a very unfortunate characterisation\", saying the attacks were \"not state sponsored\" but the \"activities of vigilante groups\".",
