   "title_cn": "刚果（金）本迪布焦型埃博拉疫情扩散至第七个省，逼近中非共和国边境",
   "title_original": "EBOLA BUNDIBUGYO VIRUS DISEASE OUTBREAK Democratic Republic of the Congo | Uganda Weekly External Situation Report 18, Data as of 13 September 2026",
   "summary_cn": "世界卫生组织非洲区域办事处通报，刚果（金）本迪布焦型埃博拉病毒病疫情已扩散至第七个省，苏德乌班吉省布卢卫生区报告首例确诊病例，该省与中非共和国和刚果（布）接壤。截至2026年9月13日，累计确诊病例7258例，其中死亡3510例，病死率48.4%。自上一期周报以来新增572例确诊病例和284例死亡病例。",
   "summary_original": "EBOLA BUNDIBUGYO VIRUS DISEASE OUTBREAK Democratic Republic of the Congo | Uganda Weekly External Situation Report 18, Data as of 13 September 2026 orlunwop@who.int Tue, 15/09/2026 - 16:26 Event description The Bundibugyo virus disease (BVD) outbreak in the Democratic Republic of the Congo has expanded to a seventh province, with the first confirmed case reported in Bulu Health Zone, Sud-Ubangi, a province bordering the Central African Republic and the Republic of the Congo. This latest geograph",
   "event_time": "2026-09-15T15:26:56Z",
