   "title_cn": "苏丹否认埃塞俄比亚关于其支持提格雷武装的指控",
   "title_original": "Sudan rejects Ethiopia’s claims of backing Tigray forces",
   "summary_cn": "苏丹军方否认埃塞俄比亚陆军指挥官关于喀土穆支持在埃塞北部与政府军作战的武装组织的指控，称这些指控“毫无根据”。埃塞俄比亚陆军参谋长比尔哈努·朱拉指控苏丹、埃及和厄立特里亚支持与联邦政府作战的力量。提格雷州战事升级，引发对重返2020至2022年内战的担忧。",
   "summary_original": "Sudan’s military is rejecting accusations from Ethiopia that Khartoum is backing armed groups fighting government forces in the north, calling the claims “baseless.”",
   "event_time": "2026-09-28T00:00:00Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-28T00:00:00Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "http://www.africanews.com/2026/09/28/sudan-rejects-ethiopias-claims-of-backing-tigray-forces/",
