   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚战斗加剧，政府军称重新夺回阿拉马塔",
   "title_original": "Ethiopia fighting intensifies as Government forces retake Alamata",
   "summary_cn": "埃塞俄比亚北部战斗加剧，亲政府武装称在与叛军多线交战后已重新控制提格雷南部战略城镇阿拉马塔。阿拉马塔位于通往提格雷的主要公路上，其失守据称标志着提格雷叛军的逆转。冲突引发对重返2020至2022年全面内战的担忧，该内战据估计造成约60万人死亡。",
   "summary_original": "Fighting is intensifying in northern Ethiopia, with pro-government forces saying they have retaken the strategic town of Alamata in southern Tigray.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-28T00:00:00Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-28T00:00:00Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
