   "event_status": "new",
   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚七个反叛组织宣布结成新联盟对抗阿比政府",
   "title_original": "Why are Ethiopia's rebels joining forces?",
   "summary_cn": "来自埃塞俄比亚各地的七个反叛组织宣布结成新的联盟，共同对抗总理阿比·艾哈迈德领导的政府。这些组织中有一些曾是竞争对手，另一些此前各自为战，如今声称因共同目标而联合。报道称，此时正值北部提格雷地区战事再度爆发。",
   "summary_original": "Seven rebel groups from across Ethiopia have announced a new alliance against Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed's government.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-28T13:21:11Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-28T13:21:11Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6n45epzdgk8o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
     "source_name": "BBC News (Africa)",
