   ],
   "potential_impact": "",
   "progress": "",
   "current_policy_passed": true,
   "quality_gate_passed": true,
   "legacy_migration_preserved": false,
   "legacy_visibility": true,
   "publication_reason": "Stage 3B 真实采集",
   "body_extracted": "Why are Ethiopia's rebels joining forces?\nTo play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.\nThis video can not be played\nWhy are Ethiopia's rebels joining forces?       Close\nSeven rebel groups from across Ethiopia have announced a new alliance against Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed's government.\nSome were once rivals, others fought separately, but they now say they're united by a common goal.\nSo, who are they, and why have they joined forces now, just as fighting has flared once more in the northern Tigray region?\nProduced by Aaron Akinyemi and Bruno Garcez\n️Edited by Aaron Akinyemi\nNarration: Victoria Uwonkunda\nSubsection\nAfrica\nPublished\n3 hours ago\nShare\nclose panel\nShare page\nCopy link\nAbout sharing\nRelated topics\nEthiopian civil war                Follow   Ethiopian civil war\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nEthiopian civil war\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in   My News   and in a collection on the   News homepage .\nEthiopia                Follow   Ethiopia\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nEthiopia\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in   My News   and in a collection on the   News homepage .\nRead description",
