   "title_original": "West Africa cannot simply import security models without accounting for local realities – WAMS",
   "summary_cn": "在阿克拉举行的第六届西非矿业安全会议（WAMS）上，发言者警告称，其他地方制定的安全策略不能在不考虑当地政治、经济和社区现实的情况下直接移植到西非采矿业。该议题成为本次会议较为务实的主题之一，与会者包括政府官员、外交官和矿业公司代表。",
   "summary_original": "Security strategies developed elsewhere cannot simply be transplanted into West Africa’s mining sector without accounting for local political, economic and community realities, speakers at the West Africa Mining Security Conference have warned. The issue emerged as one of the more practical themes at the sixth WAMS conference in Accra, where government officials, diplomats, mining companies […]",
