   "title_original": "Three migrants die in Channel crossing as boats become more overcrowded and risky",
   "summary_cn": "",
   "summary_original": "Emergency crews gathered at the port of Calais after three migrants died trying to cross the English Channel to Britain. Two women in their thirties and a 10-year-old boy, believed to be Eritrean, died in what appears to have been a crush aboard an overcrowded dinghy.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-28T00:00:00Z",
