   "title_cn": "SSOMA称基尔篡权，呼吁启动新的和平进程",
   "title_original": "SSOMA says Kiir has usurped authority, calls for new peace process",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹反对派运动联盟（SSOMA）发表声明，谴责总统萨尔瓦·基尔发动“政变”，称其解散了重振民族团结过渡政府并建立非法的看守政府。SSOMA呼吁开展真正、包容和全面的全国和平进程，并敦促国际与地区各方紧急介入。该组织还拒绝基尔计划中的选举，称其为“虚假选举”。",
   "summary_original": "The South Sudan Opposition Movements Alliance (SSOMA), led by National Salvation Front (NAS) rebel leader The post SSOMA says Kiir has usurped authority, calls for new peace process appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
