   "title_cn": "南苏丹公路伏击事件：27名被劫乘客获释，有女性报告遭强奸",
   "title_original": "27 passengers freed after road ambush, women report rape",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹西赤道州蒙德里东县Lui与Lanyi Dawa之间的公路上发生武装伏击，约32人被劫持，其中27人已获释并被家人送往朱巴，仍有人员下落不明。部分获释者称在扣押期间遭到殴打和酷刑，有女性报告遭强奸。警方表示尚未逮捕任何人，袭击动机不明，无组织宣称负责。",
   "summary_original": "At least 27 passengers abducted during an armed ambush on a road in South Sudan’s The post 27 passengers freed after road ambush, women report rape appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-09-29T08:27:50Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-29T08:27:50Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
