   "summary_cn": "喀麦隆性别暴力事件持续增加，今年以来已有至少56名女性被杀，民众愤怒情绪不断上升。妇女部上月宣布，一项将杀害女性单独列为罪行的法案将在议会11月会期审议。一名喀麦隆教师的家属要求为其遇害母亲伸张正义，其丈夫被列为头号嫌疑人。",
   "summary_original": "Anger is growing in Cameroon over rising gender-based violence that has seen at least 56 women killed since the start of the year. In response to the outcry, a bill to make femicide a separate crime from murder will be considered during parliament's November session.",
