   "body_extracted": "Cameroon\nAnger is growing in Cameroon over rising gender-based violence that has seen at least 56 women killed since the start of the year. In response to the outcry, the women's ministry announced last month that a bill to make femicide a separate crime from murder will be considered during parliament's November session after gaining widespread support.\nCourage Anushuni still cannot make sense of his pain after his mother Cameroonian teacher Geraldine Achia was beaten to death, with her husband the prime suspect.\n\"Having lost my mother is a nightmare. The shock is overwhelming. I cannot believe what happened,\" said the 18-year-old, Achia's only son, choking up as the words came out.",
