   "title_cn": "三名埃及安全官员因意大利研究员绑架案被判10年监禁",
   "title_original": "Three Egyptian nationals jailed for 10 years over Italian researcher's abduction",
   "summary_cn": "罗马一家法院周一判处三名埃及安全官员10年监禁，他们被认定在2016年开罗绑架意大利研究员Giulio Regeni一案中犯有加重绑架罪。第四名被告的谋杀指控被宣告不成立。罗马首席检察官称，判决是在埃及当局缺乏“有意义的合作”情况下作出的，被告为缺席审判。",
   "summary_original": "Three Egyptian security officials were sentenced to 10 years in jail in Rome on Monday for the 2016 abduction of an Italian researcher. The ruling marked a significant milestone in a case that has tested relations between Italy and Egypt.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-29T00:00:00Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-29T00:00:00Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
