   "title_cn": "评论：南苏丹过渡期法律终结与看守政府困局",
   "title_original": "Op-Ed| In the caretaker trap? The legal end of South Sudan’s transition",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹民族团结过渡政府于2026年9月22日解散，标志着长达六年的过渡框架结束。分析指出，尽管政府通过修宪和选举法修正案以法律途径推进，但永久宪法和人口普查仍未完成，总统权力集中风险加剧。有关“议会政变”或“新内战”的说法被指缺乏依据。",
   "summary_original": "The dissolution of South Sudan’s Revitalised Transitional Government of National Unity (R-TGoNU) on 22 September The post Op-Ed| In the caretaker trap? The legal end of South Sudan’s transition appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
