   "title_cn": "分析人士称南非犯罪网络争夺地盘助长大规模枪击事件",
   "title_original": "South Africa: Competition between criminal networks fuelling mass shootings, analysts say",
   "summary_cn": "据全球打击跨国有组织犯罪倡议组织（GI-TOC）称，有组织犯罪、帮派暴力以及犯罪网络控制权争夺正在助长南非的大规模枪击事件。自2026年初以来，南非已记录41起大规模枪击事件，造成近200人死亡。上周末约翰内斯堡和开普敦发生的枪击事件在两天内造成27人死亡。",
   "summary_original": "Organised crime, gang violence and conflicts over the control of criminal networks are fuelling mass shootings in South Africa, according to the Global Initiative Against Transnational Organized Crime.",
