   "title_cn": "从监督到影响：为何董事会委员会将决定非洲组织的成败",
   "title_original": "From Oversight to Impact: Why board committees will make or break Africa’s organisations",
   "summary_cn": "加纳阿克拉一篇评论文章指出，董事会委员会在企业成败中扮演关键角色，审计委员会负责发现或漏过财务违规，风险委员会负责预判或忽视威胁，提名与薪酬委员会则决定领导者选拔与报酬是否得当。文章称委员会仍是董事会治理中受审视最少的部分，并预告相关活动将于周三举行。该内容为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "Accra, Ghana. Behind almost every corporate success, and almost every corporate failure, sits a board committee. It is in the audit committee that financial irregularities are either caught or missed. It is in the risk committee that threats are either anticipated or ignored. It is in the nomination and remuneration committees that the right leaders are either chosen and fairly rewarded, or not. Yet committees remain among the least examined parts of boardroom governance. That changes on Wednesd",
