   "body_extracted": "Insurgents have killed at least three people and abducted 12 others in a series of incursions across Muidumbe and Macomia districts since the weekend, spreading fear among communities near the Messalo River and raising concerns about security along the EN380.\nThis post is for paying subscribers only\nSubscribe now\nAlready have an account?  Sign in\nThis post is for paying subscribers only\nSubscribe\nAlready have an account?  Log in",
