   "body_extracted": "A member of Mozambique’s Local Force militia was killed near the border between Nangade and Palma districts this week, amid increased insurgent activity in the surrounding forests.\nThis post is for paying subscribers only\nSubscribe now\nAlready have an account?  Sign in\nThis post is for paying subscribers only\nSubscribe\nAlready have an account?  Log in",
