   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚驻约翰内斯堡总领事馆发表声明，要求南非当局调查2026年9月18日至21日期间发生在布隆方丹、比勒陀利亚和埃库鲁莱尼的三起尼日利亚公民死亡事件。尼日利亚前航空部长、驻南非高级专员费米·法尼-卡约德称，2026年已有12名尼日利亚人在南非遇害。他还声称自2022年以来已有112名尼日利亚人在南非被杀，其中32人据称死于南非安全部队之手。",
   "summary_original": "THE Nigerian Consulate-General in Johannesburg has called on South African authorities to investigate the deaths of three Nigerian nationals in separate incidents between September 18 and 21, 2026. The Consulate made the call in a statement dated September 28 and signed by the Consul-General, Nnikanwa Okey-Uche. The deaths occurred in Bloemfontein, Pretoria and Ekurhuleni, according […] The post Three Nigerians killed in South Africa in four days as consulate demands probe appeared first on The ",
