   "title_cn": "尼日利亚军方解救46名被绑架者，击毙一名疑似民兵成员",
   "title_original": "Army rescues 46 kidnapped victims, neutralises suspected militia member",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚陆军在24小时内于全国多地开展行动，共解救46名被绑架者，并击毙一名疑似民兵成员。行动中还缴获枪支、破坏恐怖分子活动并解救其他受害者。相关战果来自军方提供给尼日利亚通讯社的行动报告，目前为单一来源。",
   "summary_original": "Army rescues 46 kidnapped victims, neutralises suspected militia member Troops of the Nigerian Army have rescued 46 kidnapped victims and neutralised a suspected militia member in separate operations in the last 24 hours across the country. News Agency of Nigeria",
   "event_time": "2026-09-29T23:09:07Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-29T23:09:07Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
