   "title_cn": "非洲首富拟在肯尼亚启动炼油厂项目 当地土地抗议持续",
   "title_original": "Africa's richest man to launch Kenya oil refinery despite land protests",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚亿万富翁阿里科·丹格特与肯尼亚总统威廉·鲁托计划在肯尼亚北部海岸拉穆动工建设一座价值160亿美元的炼油厂，预计日处理原油70万桶，将成为东非最大工业项目。动工前，部分当地居民上街抗议，要求为炼油厂用地提供更多补偿。丹格特否认补偿不足的指控，称抗议是当地营销商和国际参与者玩的把戏，项目将按计划于2030年完工。",
   "summary_original": "The Kenya refinery is part of Dangote's ambitious bid to expand and help industralise Africa by 2030.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-30T08:12:43Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-30T08:12:43Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmkg8dpwy25po?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
     "source_name": "BBC News (Africa)",
     "source_group": "pan",
