   "title_cn": "加纳艾滋病委员会警告：HIV污名化阻碍检测、预防与治疗",
   "title_original": "HIV stigma discourages testing, prevention and treatment in Ghana – Ghana AIDS Commission",
   "summary_cn": "加纳艾滋病委员会（GAC）警告称，围绕HIV的污名化正在阻碍人们获取预防、检测、治疗和支持服务。委员会总干事Kharmacelle Prosper Akanbong博士表示，将HIV感染自动等同于滥交的误解持续影响着病毒携带者所受的对待。他称这类观念既不公正，也削弱了相关防治努力。",
   "summary_original": "Stigma surrounding HIV is discouraging people from accessing prevention, testing, treatment and support services, the Ghana AIDS Commission (GAC) has warned. The Director-General of the Commission, Dr Kharmacelle Prosper Akanbong, said misconceptions linking HIV infection automatically to promiscuity continue to influence how people living with the virus are treated. Speaking on Konsulting Room 5 on JoyNews, Dr Akanbong said such perceptions were not only unfair but were also undermining efforts",
