   "title_cn": "洪水与饥荒加剧南苏丹坦布拉流离失所者困境",
   "title_original": "Flooding, hunger worsen hardships for Tambura IDPs",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹西赤道州坦布拉县连日强降雨导致多个流离失所者营地被淹，简易住所受损，居民被迫转移至高处。当地流离失所者代表称，洪水加剧了原有的饥荒、医疗匮乏和教育中断问题，并警告积水可能引发疟疾等疾病。当地官员表示食品价格上涨，弱势群体已有人因饥饿死亡，居民呼吁政府和人道组织提供紧急援助。",
   "summary_original": "Flooding, hunger, limited healthcare, and disrupted education are worsening the humanitarian situation of internally displaced The post Flooding, hunger worsen hardships for Tambura IDPs appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-09-30T13:58:19Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-30T13:58:19Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.radiotamazuj.org/en/news/article/flooding-hunger-worsen-hardships-for-tambura-idps",
     "source_name": "Radio Tamazuj",
     "source_group": "ssd",
     "language": "en"
