   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚提格雷地区战斗升级，据称造成52名平民死亡",
   "title_original": "Ethiopia fighting escalates in Tigray killing 52 civilians, medic tells the BBC",
   "summary_cn": "据医院消息人士向BBC透露，埃塞俄比亚北部提格雷地区阿拉马塔周边持续三天的激烈战斗已造成至少52名平民死亡。战斗还波及邻近地区，导致33名游客滞留在拉利贝拉。冲突双方互相指责对方违反2022年结束内战的协议，目前尚不清楚谁先发动了最新战斗。",
   "summary_original": "The deadly fighting has also spread to neighbouring regions, stranding tourists in Lalibela.",
   "event_time": "2026-09-30T15:04:32Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-30T15:04:32Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6grveejg1e2o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
