   "body_extracted": "Islamist insurgents captured and killed two civilians near Maputo village, in Mocímboa da Praia district, on Monday 28 September, according to a claim issued by Islamic State yesterday.\nA local source confirmed to  Zitamar  that insurgents entered the village on the night of 28 September and abducted some people. The number of abductees remains unclear. Maputo village is about 25km north of Mocímboa da Praia town.\nThis post is for subscribers only\nSubscribe now\nAlready have an account?  Sign in\nThis post is for subscribers only\nSubscribe\nAlready have an account?  Log in",
