   "title_cn": "尼日利亚国家应急管理局在洪水预警前开展搜救培训",
   "title_original": "NEMA trains staff on search, rescue ahead of flood alert",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚国家应急管理局（NEMA）周三为工作人员组织搜救复训，以加强应对即将到来的洪水。尼日利亚水文服务局（NIHSA）此前预警称约15个州将出现严重山洪和河流洪水。NEMA局长已指示全部17个外地办事处提升洪水应对准备。",
   "summary_original": "NEMA trains staff on search, rescue ahead of flood alert By Philomina Attah The National Emergency Management Agency (NEMA) on Wednesday organised a refresher training on Search and Rescue for its staff as… News Agency of Nigeria",
