   "title_cn": "琼莱州Twic East与Duk两县任命看守专员，紧张局势持续",
   "title_original": "Twic East, Duk counties get caretaker commissioners as tensions remain high",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹琼莱州新任看守州长Moses Majok Gatluak任命了Twic East和Duk两县的看守专员。这两个地区的青年自2023年以来间歇性发生暴力冲突，近几周局势升级，上周Twic East一武装青年团体袭击Duk县Apiir Palaidhiim村居民，造成十余人死亡。当地妇女协会欢迎任命，并呼吁州长成立和平委员会以对话解决暴力根源。",
   "summary_original": "The newly appointed caretaker governor of Jonglei State, Moses Majok Gatluak, has appointed caretaker commissioners The post Twic East, Duk counties get caretaker commissioners as tensions remain high appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-10-01T06:05:40Z",
   "published_time": "2026-10-01T06:05:40Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
