   "title_cn": "洪水致南苏丹坦布拉流离失所者处境艰难",
   "title_original": "Flooding leaves Tambura IDPs in desperate need",
   "summary_cn": "南苏丹西赤道州坦布拉县连日暴雨引发洪水，多个流离失所者营地被淹，简易住所受损，部分家庭被迫转移至高地。当地居民与官员称，洪水加剧了食品短缺、医疗与教育服务匮乏等问题，营地内一加仑木薯售价约6000南苏丹镑。居民呼吁提供食品、药品、住所及改善排水等紧急援助。",
   "summary_original": "Flooding, food shortages and limited access to healthcare and education are worsening conditions for internally The post Flooding leaves Tambura IDPs in desperate need appeared first on Radio Tamazuj .",
   "event_time": "2026-10-01T09:11:50Z",
   "published_time": "2026-10-01T09:11:50Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.radiotamazuj.org/en/news/article/flooding-leaves-tambura-idps-in-desperate-need",
