   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚：联邦军队在提格雷推进，据报52名平民丧生",
   "title_original": "Ethiopia: federal forces advance in Tigray as 52 civilians reported killed",
   "summary_cn": "埃塞俄比亚北部冲突加剧，联邦军队在重新夺回战略城镇阿拉马塔后继续向提格雷推进。医院消息人士告诉BBC，阿拉马塔周边三天战斗中至少有52名平民丧生，另有700多名伤者在提格雷各地由无国界医生支持的医院接受治疗。冲突还蔓延至邻近的阿法尔和阿姆哈拉地区，通信中断使独立核实战场说法变得困难。",
   "summary_original": "The conflict is also spreading beyond Tigray, with fighting reported in neighbouring Afar and Amhara regions. Communications remain disrupted, making independent verification of battlefield claims difficult.",
   "event_time": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
   "published_time": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
