   "title_original": "Afoko can help rebuild NPP and bring back disgruntled members – Political Scientist",
   "summary_cn": "加纳夸梅·恩克鲁玛科技大学高级讲师夸西·阿马基耶-博阿滕博士公开支持新爱国党前全国主席阿文塔米·保罗·阿福科参选党主席，称其是最能帮助该党重建的人选。他在库马西Akoma FM电台发表上述言论。该报道为单一来源。",
   "summary_original": "Senior Lecturer at the Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology (KNUST), Dr Kwasi Amakye-Boateng, has backed former National Chairman of the New Patriotic Party (NPP), Awentami Paul Afoko, in the party’s chairmanship race, describing him as the candidate he considers best placed to help rebuild the party. Speaking on Kumasi-based Akoma FM, Dr Amakye-Boateng […]",
