   "title_original": "Ghana’s trade surplus shrinks by 70% to US$1.3bn in quarter 2, 2026 – GSS",
   "summary_cn": "据加纳统计局（GSS）数据，2026年第二季度加纳贸易顺差收窄70%，降至13亿美元。出口仅微增1.6%，而进口大幅增长47.5%，顺差缩小几乎完全源于进口增加。该数据为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "According to the GSS, exports barely increased as it went down by 1.6%, while imports jumped by 47.5%. Therefore, the smaller surplus came almost entirely from buying more.",
