   "title_cn": "移动实验室加快刚果（金）东部埃博拉检测速度",
   "title_original": "Mobile labs speed up Ebola testing in eastern DR Congo",
   "summary_cn": "在刚果（金）东部，移动实验室已运行两周，帮助疫情重灾区医护人员更快获得埃博拉检测结果。在布滕博的一处实验室，样本可现场检测，且整个设施可随时转移至其他社区应对紧急情况。",
   "summary_original": "In the eastern Democratic Republic of Congo, a mobile lab has been operating for two weeks, a welcome relief to staff at the nearby Ebola treatment centre who said that getting a test result used to take 72 hours.",
   "event_time": "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z",
