   "event_status": "new",
   "title_cn": "埃塞俄比亚与厄立特里亚因北部冲突升级断绝外交关系",
   "title_original": "Ethiopia and Eritrea cut diplomatic ties as northern conflict escalates",
   "summary_cn": "埃塞俄比亚与厄立特里亚宣布断绝外交关系，此前埃塞俄比亚以威胁国家安全为由关闭驻阿斯马拉使馆并要求10名厄立特里亚外交官48小时内离境。厄立特里亚称别无选择只能对等回应。与此同时，埃塞俄比亚北部提格雷、阿法尔和阿姆哈拉地区联邦部队与提格雷人民解放阵线及其盟友持续交战，据报已有超过50人丧生。",
   "summary_original": "The diplomatic fallout comes as Ethiopian forces battle rebel fighters across its northern region.",
   "event_time": "2026-10-02T05:42:07Z",
   "published_time": "2026-10-02T05:42:07Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crpd0d0jl0y0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
     "source_name": "BBC News (Africa)",
     "source_group": "pan",
