   "body_extracted": "Guinea\nEven in death, former Guinean Prime Minister Sidya Touré will remain in exile, as his family says he will be buried in Ivory Coast, RFI reported.\nThe 81-year old   died in Paris last week  where he had been receiving treatment after falling ill in Abidjan.\nTouré had been living in exile in Ivory Coast since the 2021 military coup that brought Guinea's current president  Mamadi Doumbouya   to power.",
