   "title_cn": "加纳三大教师工会重申全国罢工仍在进行，呼吁教师留在家中",
   "title_original": "Strike still in force, stay home – GNAT, NAGRAT and PRETAG tell teachers",
   "summary_cn": "加纳全国教师协会（GNAT）、全国研究生教师协会（NAGRAT）和加纳学前教育教师协会（PRETAG）的大阿克拉地区领导层重申支持三大教师工会宣布的全国性罢工。工会方面呼吁教师继续留在家中，罢工仍在进行。该消息目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "The Greater Accra leadership of the Ghana National Association of Teachers (GNAT), the National Association of Graduate Teachers (NAGRAT) and the Pre-Tertiary Teachers Association of Ghana (PRETAG) have reaffirmed its support for the nationwide strike declared by the three teacher unions.",
