   "title_cn": "CEO每日洞察：将第四季度优先事项转化为可衡量成果",
   "title_original": "Daily Insight for CEOs: Turning Q4 priorities into measurable results",
   "summary_cn": "一篇面向CEO的管理评论指出，战略优先事项只有转化为执行才能创造价值。CEO需确保第四季度优先事项有明确负责人、可衡量目标、现实时间表和所需资源。该内容为一般商业管理建议，不涉及安全事件。",
   "summary_original": "A strategic priority creates value only when it is translated into execution. CEOs must ensure that Q4 priorities have clear owners, measurable targets, realistic timelines, and the resources required to deliver them.",
