   "title_original": "Parent seeks Tinubu’s intervention over abduction of NYSC members on Independence Day",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚独立日当天，数名前往orientation营地的准国家青年服务团（NYSC）成员在伊莫州Owerri-Onitsha公路Umunoha附近乘车途中遭疑似枪手袭击绑架。一名家长呼吁总统博拉·蒂努布介入营救。伊莫州警方证实袭击事件，称已部署战术小组并救出10名受害者，但被掳走的确切人数仍在核实中。",
   "summary_original": "ONE of the parents of prospective National Youth Service Corps (NYSC) members who were abducted while travelling to orientation camps on Nigeria’s Independence Day has appealed to President Bola Tinubu to intervene in their rescue. The incident occurred at about 6:30 a.m. on Thursday, October 1, along the Owerri-Onitsha Road near Umunoha, Imo State, when […] The post Parent seeks Tinubu’s intervention over abduction of NYSC members on Independence Day appeared first on The ICIR- Latest News, Pol",
